"The master bedroom, approx. 55 m²: a 180×200 cm bed, 55-inch 4K TV, private balcony, its own air conditioning and an en-suite bathroom.",
"A 160×200 cm bed, smart TV, its own air conditioning and an en-suite bathroom – a comfortable room for a quiet evening.",
"A 160×200 cm bed, smart TV, its own air conditioning and an en-suite bathroom. This is an interior room with no window – quiet and dark for sleeping.",
"Each of the 3 bedrooms has its own en-suite bathroom, and there is an extra guest WC in the living area – so nobody has to queue in the morning. Rain showers, towels, hair dryers and handrails are provided.",
"A separate room for evenings together – a villa with karaoke: sing, watch films on the 4K projector home cinema or play on the PlayStation with PlayStation Plus. The 4K smart TVs have Netflix (streaming depends on the available account and content).",
"Approx. 56–60 m² on the top floor: BBQ and smoker, an outdoor lounge sofa with cushions and padded stools, plants and solar lights – with a direct view of the river and the District 1 skyline. A house with river view, from breakfast to sunset.",
